# modes.scn: tick mode changes, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# Frame to fast and back in the middle of a period (after a sound end), standby carrying the period over and
# shortening the RTC half-period, off going from RTC edge to RTC edge, and on from off loading a full period.
enable 0x2100
tick 1
idle 2
sound 10 0
idle 1
tick 2
idle 3
sound 2 1
idle 1
tick 1
idle 3
tick 3
idle 5
tick 0
idle 4
tick 3
idle 40
tick 0
idle 1
tick 1
idle 3
